@startuml
title Workflow Execution State Diagram

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam state {
    BackgroundColor White
    BorderColor Black
    ArrowColor Black
}

[*] --> Created

Created --> Planning : Start Workflow

Planning --> Executing : Plan Generated
Planning --> Failed : Planning Error

Executing --> WaitingForTool : Tool Required
WaitingForTool --> Executing : Tool Completed

Executing --> WaitingForUser : User Input Required
WaitingForUser --> Executing : User Responded

Executing --> Completed : Success

Executing --> Failed : Unrecoverable Error
WaitingForTool --> Failed : Tool Failure
WaitingForUser --> Failed : Timeout

Failed --> Retrying : Retry Enabled
Retrying --> Executing : Retry Successful
Retrying --> Failed : Retry Limit Exceeded

Completed --> Archived : Retention Policy

Archived --> [*]

@enduml